for i ulong len MetaWant
if ne get Outb add i 1 get MetaWant i
same = false
end
end
test same
note Exercise the actual appask -> qsubmit job snapshot, not only metadata helpers.
prompt
test appask 1
test eq get R 0 1
test eq get Q 1 1
test eq get R 9 1
n = get T 8
test ge n len MetaWant
same = ge n len MetaWant
if same
for i ulong len MetaWant
if ne get JobOut add sub n len MetaWant i get MetaWant i
same = false
end
end
end
test same
test not ctxbegin
test eq ctxtake 0 0
appcancel
note Exact append capacity and one byte above, preserving Outb/length/error on refusal.
test ctxmeta 6
n = sub ulong 4096 get Mx 0
put Outlen 0 n
for i ulong n
put Outb i 90
end
test ctxappend
test eq get Outlen 0 4096
put Outlen 0 add n 1
put Outb n 88
test not ctxappend
test eq get Outlen 0 add n 1
test eq get Outb n 88
put Err 0 5
test not ctxappend
test eq get Err 0 5
outreset
mset32 36 5
test not ctxmeta 6
mset32 36 4
mset32 32 33
prompt
test not appask 2
test eq get R 0 1
test eq get Q 1 1
mset32 32 1
note Deliberately full valid facts make metadata fit but the whole JOB exceed4096.
for i ulong 3692
put Mem i 0
end
mset32 32 32
for k ulong 32
off = add 40 mul k 113
for i ulong 47
put Mem add off i 107
end
for i ulong 63
put Mem add add off 48 i 118
end
end
test ctxmeta 6
test le get Mx 0 4096
prompt
test not appask 2
test eq get R 0 1
test eq get Q 1 1
test eq get R 9 1
note Catalog capacity and transaction exclusion.
mset32 36 512
test ctxbegin
test eq get Cx 0 512
test eq ctxtake 512 0
