test eq get Mx 0 len Emptyctx
note Context construction cannot overwrite a staged memory/note transaction image.
for i ulong 4096
put Unitsave i get Unit i
put Unitsave add i 4096 get Enc i
end
test ctxmeta 6
same = true
for i ulong 4096
if ne get Unit i get Unitsave i
same = false
end
if ne get Enc i get Unitsave add i 4096
same = false
end
end
test same
memsetup
